<div  class="c-card c-card--stacked">
  <div class="c-card__row">
            <div class="c-card__inner">
      <h3 class="c-card__title">
                  <a href="/resources-tools/resources/if-you-see-something-say-somethingr-campaign">
                  If You See Something, Say Something
                  </a>
              </h3>
                          <div class="c-card__body"><p>Everyone has the power to stop a threat and help secure the nation. Read about how, by just reporting suspicious activity or strange behavior, you play an essential role in keeping our communities safe and secure.</p></div>
